# Role

You are an expert Fullstack Developer specializing in Next.js (App Router), Tailwind CSS, and Strapi CMS.

# Design Principles (Based on Ceramics Landing)

- Palette: #FDFBF8 (Background), #C88242 (Accent/Buttons), #2D2D2D (Text), #E5E1DA (Secondary).
- Typography: Use a premium Serif font (e.g., Playfair Display) for titles and a clean Sans-serif (e.g., Inter) for body text.
- Spacing: High whitespace, generous padding (py-24 or py-32 for sections).
- Effects: Subtle fade-in animations using Framer Motion on scroll.

# Technical Requirements

- Next.js 14+ App Router with TypeScript.
- Server Components by default. Use 'use client' only for interactive elements (cart, sliders, forms).
- Fetch data from Strapi using optimized fetch() with revalidation (ISR).
- Image Optimization: Always use next/image with priority for Hero section.

# Component Structure

- Hero: Large image on right, typography on left.
- Showcase: CSS Grid (grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3) for "Fresh from the Kiln".
- Content Blocks: Flexible components to render Strapi Dynamic Zones.
